# Who wakes (owner 2026-09-17): "new game" on the title opens the character page,
# a body is made there row by row on the real keys, "begin" starts the game, and
# the SAME body stands on the coast and on the gear page (AvatarState is the body
# GearLook dresses). Each frame after the start is held to the walking figure
# having what was chosen (`avatar:KEY=VALUE`).
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/character.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0
coast calm
tap pause
choose title
tap use
await saved 2
await title 30
wait 0.5
# Leaving wrote the autosave, so new game asks once more before it goes on.
key move_down
key use
wait 0.4
key use
await character 8
wait 0.5
shot 01-who-wakes
# build: man, woman, heavy
key move_right
key move_right
# skin: brown to tan
key move_down
key move_right
# hair (past the tone): crop to long
key move_down
key move_down
key move_right
# hair colour: dark to red
key move_down
key move_right
# beard: none to chin
key move_down
key move_right
wait 0.8
shot 02-a-body-on-the-page
# Begin is the last row; up from the top wraps round to it.
key move_up
key move_up
key move_up
key move_up
key move_up
key move_up
wait 0.3
shot 03-begin-chosen
key use
await game 40
coast calm
zoom 4
wait 1.5
shot 04-that-body-on-its-feet with avatar:build=heavy,avatar:skin=tan,avatar:hair_style=long,avatar:hair=red,avatar:beard=chin
tap pause
choose loadout
tap use
await app:loadout 10
wait 1.0
shot 05-the-gear-page-draws-the-same-body with app:loadout,avatar:build=heavy,avatar:beard=chin
